{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate to the beat, but don't trip over your feet! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate &amp; Date is a roller derby, rhythm ga(y)me about expressing yourself and falling in love. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Maggie, a highschooler on the Rockin' Rollergirls who has a crush on one of her rivals - Patricia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play through the Story Mode or kick back in Free Skate mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cute story mode about high school and roller derby</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/51584367841a3c4b9b4665f487bc3649.avif?t=1758079662\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A rhythm game that affects the story depending on what you do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/41fdeeea6436916d13c672c4909cb9cc.poster.avif?t=1758079662\" width=784 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/41fdeeea6436916d13c672c4909cb9cc.webm?t=1758079662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/41fdeeea6436916d13c672c4909cb9cc.mp4?t=1758079662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choices that change depending on how you play the rhythm game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.poster.avif?t=1758079662\" width=784 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.webm?t=1758079662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/01eb9a4b61cfac5205bca0679bd870b7.mp4?t=1758079662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Funky Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/3034089127507cea970a7d81d009acbf.avif?t=1758079662\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different Difficulty Modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free Skate for when you want to practice your groovy moves </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lesbians, harold!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/extras/1f24132293ea52ff2cab49892b948d15.avif?t=1758079662\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1033380?t=1758079662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1033380?t=1758079662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/93b1259ede339e41bbf01dab6671fcd0362e526b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758079662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1033380/93b1259ede339e41bbf01dab6671fcd0362e526b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758079662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"d